- Diederik P. Kingma, Max Welling. [Auto-Encoding Variational Bayes](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114). ICLR 2014.
- Danilo Jimenez Rezende, Shakir Mohamed, Daan Wierstra. [Stochastic Backpropagation and Approximate Inference in Deep Generative Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.4082). ICML 2014.
- Christopher P. Burgess, Irina Higgins, Arka Pal, Loic Matthey, Nick Watters, Guillaume Desjardins, Alexander Lerchner. [Understanding disentangling in β-VAE](https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.03599). 2018.
